{
  "name": "Qualify B2B Leads by Website Tech Stack, Ad Pixels & DNS SaaS Signals",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Qualify B2B Leads by Website Tech Stack, Ad Pixels & DNS SaaS\n\n### How it works\nThis workflow qualifies B2B prospect domains using live technographics, paid ad conversion pixels, and DNS-verified SaaS signals:\n1. **Manual Trigger** and **Set Prospect Domains** supply the list of company domains to inspect.\n2. **Scan Tech Stack, Pixels & DNS SaaS** calls `POST /scan` on RapidAPI (`website-tech-stack-ad-pixels-and-saas-detector`) to detect 180+ web technologies, consent-gated GTM ad pixels, and 70+ DNS-verified B2B SaaS tools (`MX`/`TXT`/`DMARC`), even when a domain returns HTTP 403 behind a WAF. **Split Out Scanned Domains** separates each scanned company.\n3. **Filter Qualified B2B Prospects** passes accounts that either run paid ad pixels (`hasAdPixels = true`, excluding publisher scripts like AdSense) or have at least 3 verified DNS SaaS tools.\n4. **Format Technographic Summary** shapes key fields and **Notify Sales Channel on Slack** posts qualified leads to `#sales-signals`.\n\n### Setup\n1. Subscribe to the free Basic plan on RapidAPI (`website-tech-stack-ad-pixels-and-saas-detector`).\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential named `RapidAPI Key` (`x-rapidapi-key`) and select it in **Scan Tech Stack, Pixels & DNS SaaS**.\n3. Connect your **Slack** credential and choose a channel in **Notify Sales Channel on Slack**.\n4. Update **Set Prospect Domains** and click **Execute workflow**.\n\n### Customization\n- Swap **Manual Trigger** for a **HubSpot**, **Google Sheets**, or **Webhook** trigger for continuous inbound lead scoring.\n- Adjust the qualification rule in **Filter Qualified B2B Prospects** (for example, require specific ad platforms or increase the DNS SaaS threshold).",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "tech-s-overview-note",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Trigger & Prospect Domains\nStarts the workflow and supplies the target company domains for technographic qualification.\n\n*Tip: Swap Manual Trigger for a CRM or Webhook trigger.*",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "stk-sec-1",
      "name": "Step 1: Trigger & Domains",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Batch Technographic Scan\nCalls `POST /scan` to detect web tech, paid ad pixels, and WAF-resilient DNS SaaS (`MX`/`TXT`/`DMARC`), then splits each domain item.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "stk-sec-2",
      "name": "Step 2: Scan & Split",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
